og","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","review_id":"tq_hiIFnnUF_BqvCZsScxQ","date":"2017-03-18T17:27:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9425608515739441,"text_excerpt":"What a cute dessert spot! It's a high end bakery/pastry boutique, where their desserts are too pretty to eat. My friends and I were visiting NOLA and this was a must stop for us. There's a big assortment of chocolates, pastries, macarons and gelatos. Although we wanted to try everything, we decided to try just a few sweets. We got their famous vanilla eclair, smores skillet with a scoop of macaron fudge swirl gelato and some drip coffee. We took a bunch of photos before devouring our desserts. Everything was delicious and not overly sweet, which was perfect. The gelato I must say was pretty yummy and wish I could've tried some other flavors. I plan on visiting here again the next time I'm..."},{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","review_id":"SOHuK5Zp7m-3sECPMzQioA","date":"2013-05-19T19:07:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.942237138748169,"text_excerpt":"Sucre is my go to dessert joint! I really heart this place and have the frequent buyer card to prove it! Hehe... When it's hot outside I can't resist the gelato (a small can come with two different flavors, the pistachio is delish!) and when it's cold outside I MUST have the largest lavender vanilla hot chocolate with whipped cream on top. This is the first place I tried macaroons and I totally get why people love them now! This past Mardi Gras I also bought one of their king cakes for the Orpheus ball and it was a huge hit! Not only is it beautiful on the outside but tasty on the inside! The last time I went I shared several desserts with my friends red velvet cake with gelato, chocolate..."},{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","review_id":"nUCC8I3gmv0_ctM_JvZsNQ","date":"2013-11-12T03:32:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9422180652618408,"text_excerpt":"I love this place - it's a very glossy high-end candy, dessert, and gelato shop. My mom goes nuts in here whenever she visits from out of town. I don't go here very often - it's more of a special treat place. Got the lemon curd gelato and a salted caramel macaroon during the most recent visit - both delicious. Small boxes of Sucre chocolates make great gifts!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","photo_id":"Y6EWZpuI6qY3A79SAX3BWA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y6EWZpuI6qY3A79SAX3BWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9317876100540161},{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","photo_id":"NRcFfURDVFY5axKPBMl6mw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NRcFfURDVFY5axKPBMl6mw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9106537699699402},{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","photo_id":"-7zOWB886aaAWsxNyr6woA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-7zOWB886aaAWsxNyr6woA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8530057072639465},{"business_id":"jar_5KMQZtgOseRdUN3L0w","photo_id":"9EUZJ9tUumhXwXv7FVAo9g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9EUZJ9tUumhXwXv7FVAo9g.jpg","visual_representati